## 🚀 Instant 1-Line Setup (`mcp_config.json`)

Add this block to your `mcp_config.json` in Antigravity IDE or Claude Desktop:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "godkiller": {
      "command": "uvx",
      "args": ["godkiller-mcp"]
    }
  }
}
```

